    {
      "url": "https://www.blooket.com/",
      "title": "Blooket – Fun, Free, Educational Games for Everyone",
      "text": "Accept cookies from Blooket?\n\nCookies are small files placed on your device that collect information when you use Blooket. Essential cookies are used to make our site work and are required. Other types of cookies are used to improve your experience, to analyze how Blooket is used, and to market our service. By clicking “Accept All”, you agree to allow these other cookies.\n\nCustomize\nReject All\nAccept All\nBlooket\nJoin a game\nLog in\nFun, free, educational games for everyone!\nSign up\n \n\nPronounced (\"Blue-kit\")\n\nClick to scroll down\n\nEasy Setup,\nLasting Results\n\nFind a question set from our library or create your own. Then, get started with a live or asynchronous game in just a few clicks!\n\nInstant Feedback\n\nEnsure every student is on track with detailed reports at the end of each game. Identify knowledge gaps and guide students toward success.\n\nFree, Fresh, and Fun\n\nKeep your students engaged with our ever-expanding library of game modes. We're always working on new ways to make learning fun!\n\nSerious Learning. Serious Fun.\n\nJoin the millions of educators around the world who have already discovered the power of Blooket!\n\nGet started\nHow It Works\nGet a question set\nChoose a game mode\nPlay, learn, and analyze\nEngagement for Everyone\n\nBlooket’s gameplay is designed for students from early elementary to high school and beyond!\n\nProduct\n\nUpgrade\nGroup Plans\n\nContact\n\nHelp Center\nFAQ\ncontact-us@blooket.com\n\nMore\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Service\nCookie Settings\nCreated by Ben Stewart\n\nConnect\n\nCopyright © 2026 Blooket LLC. All Rights Reserved.",
